# Toolchains the release floor gate requires. Update deliberately: the floor
# is a compatibility promise to consumers, reviewed at each dependency sweep.
#
# This file is the MSRV floor only. The stable toolchain Longhorn builds and
# releases with is pinned in rust-toolchain.toml at the repository root; do not
# copy it here.
#
# After raising LONGHORN_GENERAL_MSRV (and matching rust-version), install the
# new toolchain and run `effigy release:floor` before committing the bump.
# A higher MSRV unlocks Clippy lints on pre-existing code; discovering that
# mid-release-prep is the expensive path.
LONGHORN_GENERAL_MSRV=1.95.0
